{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1145752-question-to-sorcery-hellfire-blade","id":1145752,"title":"Question to sorcery hellfire blade","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-01T04:08:26-07:00","id":1145752,"title":"Question to sorcery hellfire blade","content":"Hello everyone a quick question to <br /> <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Hellfire\" target=\"_blank\">http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Hellfire</a><br /> <br /> At level 2 in this path one may learn the ritual hellfire blade - how do you actually use it in combat though? Do you just will it and it happens (given the roll succeeds) or do you need additional mumbo jumbo like the similiar Valeren power that lets your blade burn requires the blade to be covered in your vampiric blood first?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4364-orkar","name":"Orkar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4364_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-01T06:27:09-07:00","id":1145775,"title":"","content":"Depends on the Paradigm.<br /> <br /> It might be a prayer (Celestial Chorus), anointed with blood (Verbena) or charged with free floating ionic vapors (techno something).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5818-eviltyger","name":"EvilTyger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-01T08:38:25-07:00","id":1145805,"title":"","content":"I may need to specify im not talking about an actual mage but a sorceror, a hedge wizard - so not a member of the awakened in medieval europe","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4364-orkar","name":"Orkar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4364_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-01T09:31:14-07:00","id":1145818,"title":"","content":"According to sorcerer revised it requires a willpower point but it Also requires a manipulation + occult roll and it lasts a scene, so it would require an action to use and last till the scene is over. Your character might chant or run their hand along the blade, but such things are not required, the roll is all it will take.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3729-darkfoxdev","name":"Darkfoxdev","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-01T09:52:52-07:00","id":1145826,"title":"","content":"Thanks, running along the blade it is then =)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4364-orkar","name":"Orkar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4364_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T10:16:50-07:00","id":1147092,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Orkar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1145752-question-to-sorcery-hellfire-blade?p=1145805#post1145805\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I may need to specify im not talking about an actual mage but a sorceror, a hedge wizard - so not a member of the awakened in medieval europe</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorcerers have paradigms too, just an FYI. Rely on them a lot more than Mages, tbh. But, yeah, like fox said, it's ultimately just the wp point and doing whatever action seems appropriate to your char's paradigm. If running a hand along the blade works for your char then that's all it takes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4017-angryicecream","name":"angryicecream","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-08T01:06:16-07:00","id":1147957,"title":"","content":"I think it implies that you perform the spell and then just draw the blade at a later date.<br /> <br /> As long as you will the magic to work, then it should be good to go","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3148-zennis","name":"Zennis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}